        "original_id": "5f0cb4ce-f334-5901-b516-196684a0f8dd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sid Hatfield\n- Places: Matewan, West Virginia\n- Events: Battle of Matewan\n- Organizations: Baldwin-Felts Detective Agency, local coal miners\n- Roles: Police Chief\n\nFacts:\n- Sid Hatfield was born on May 15 in either 1891 or 1893 and died on August 1, 1921.\n- Sid Hatfield was the Police Chief of Matewan, West Virginia during the Battle of Matewan.\n- The Battle of Matewan occurred on May 19, 1920.\n- The Battle of Matewan was a shootout between local coal miners and the Baldwin-Felts Detective Agency.\n- The Battle of Matewan followed a series of evictions carried out by detectives from the Baldwin-Felts Detective Agency.",
